sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Bot as Telegram or CLI entry
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant Orch as Hub orchestrator
    participant Mem as Hub memory store
    participant FB as Factory Brain

    You->>Bot: factory-style request
    Bot->>Orch: forward message
    Orch->>Mem: load relevant preferences
    Mem-->>Orch: active preference records
    Note over Orch,FB: Factory requests use a resumable Hub thread<br/>Hub keeps the factory thread id in task context
    Orch->>Orch: LLM routes request to Factory Brain
    Orch->>Runs: transition routed -> dispatched -> in_progress
    Orch->>FB: invoke design request

    FB-->>Orch: interrupted, approval_token
    Orch->>Runs: transition waiting_approval
    Orch-->>Bot: approval-required response
    Bot-->>You: spec summary and /approve hint

    You->>Bot: /approve
    Bot->>Orch: approve paused run
    Orch->>Runs: transition routed
    Orch->>FB: resume using saved factory thread

    FB-->>Orch: success response
    Orch->>Runs: finalize succeeded
    Orch-->>Bot: operator-facing response
    Bot-->>You: result
